  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Beast snagga" id="1de5-29dc-f447-3f47" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Beast snagga" id="68b5-9e3b-fe69-7a44" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this ability makes an attack that targets a VEHICLE or MONSTER, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.
- Every time a model in this unit loses a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Ramshackle" id="bc61-0bad-5371-b83f" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Ramshackle" id="75e3-b33a-57ad-f93c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack of strength 7 or less is allocated to this model, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack (to a minimum of 1).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Warboss" id="4aae-d6cb-875c-316d" hidden="false">
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Warcry" id="7bd3-29ea-b608-57e7" hidden="false" targetId="6ec6-f35f-b886-5a54" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name=" Warboss [Aura]" id="dd79-5eb4-996e-bec5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; CORE or &lt;CLAN&gt; CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Waaagh!!!" id="4bf5-0e3d-69a8-1087" hidden="false" typeId="aa4f-e7db-d02d-9251" typeName="Waaagh!!!">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="First Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="ac36-74d5-e40d-579e">- ORK CORE and ORK CHARACTER units from your army are eligible to declare a charge even if they Advanced this turn.
- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORK models from your army.
- When a ORK model from your army, are about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a 5+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Second Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="8c77-964a-3e5e-9bda">- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORKS model from your army.
- When ORK model from your army, are about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="15e7-ffe5-1f1b-384e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Waaagh!!!" id="8742-8264-b968-16e0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per battle, in your Command phase, you can declare Waaagh!!!
- Each Phase of a Waaagh!!! lasts until your next Command phase.
- Only one Warcry can be active for your army during a turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="15e7-ffe5-1f1b-384e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Speedboss" id="30b1-826a-bb6d-6e51" hidden="false">
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name=" Warboss [Aura]" id="0acf-7520-f919-5aea" hidden="false" targetId="dd79-5eb4-996e-bec5" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Warcry" id="fe0d-e022-9222-4ee8" hidden="false" targetId="6ec6-f35f-b886-5a54" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Speedwaaagh!!!" id="8fab-82bd-17e7-455e" hidden="false" typeId="aa4f-e7db-d02d-9251" typeName="Waaagh!!!">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="First Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="ac36-74d5-e40d-579e">- ORKS models from your army do not suffer the penalty incurred to their hit rolls for firing Assault weapons in the same turn their unit Advanced. In addition, they can advance and shoot with Dakka and Rapid fire weapons, substract 1 from the hit roll when doing so.
- Each time a model in an ORK unit from your army makes a ranged attack, on a 6+ scores an additional hit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Second Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="8c77-964a-3e5e-9bda">- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORK models from your army.
- Each time a model in an ORK unit from your army makes a ranged attack, on a 6+ scores an additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="15e7-ffe5-1f1b-384e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Speedwaaagh!!!" id="49f7-55e9-eb37-d4f4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per battle, in your Command phase, you can declare Speedwaaagh!!!
- Each Phase of a Waaagh!!! lasts until your next Command phase.
- Only one Warcry can be active for your army during a turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="15e7-ffe5-1f1b-384e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
