            <profile name="Da Great Waaagh!!!" id="11a0-9999-d44d-1ab7" hidden="false" typeId="837d-1ddc-bb43-c500" typeName="Da Great Waaagh!!!">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="First Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="a848-d5f4-903f-4d3b">- ORKS CORE and ORKS CHARACTER units from your army are eligible to declare a charge even if they Advanced this turn.
- ORKS models from your army do not suffer the penalty incurred to their hit rolls for firing Assault weapons in the same turn their unit Advanced. In addition, they can advance and shoot with Dakka and Rapid fire weapons, substract 1 from the hit roll when doing so. 
- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army.
- Each time a model in an ORKS VEHICLE, BIKER and CAVALRY units from your army makes a ranged attack, on a 6+ scores an additional hit.
- When ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army, are about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a 5+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Second Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="5b8c-b3a2-bc15-1081">- ORKS models from your army do not suffer the penalty incurred to their hit rolls for firing Assault weapons in the same turn their unit Advanced. In addition, they can advance and shoot with Dakka and Rapid fire weapons, substract 1 from the hit roll when doing so. 
- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army.
- Each time a model in an ORKS VEHICLE, BIKER and CAVALRY units from your army makes a ranged attack, on a 6+ scores an additional hit.
- When ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army, are about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Third Waaagh!!! phase" typeId="aa15-4a19-0fcc-5580">- Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army.
- When ORKS INFANTRY, BIKER and BEAST models from your army, are about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
