            </modifier>
            <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="When this unit is destroyed, roll a D6. On a 2+ you can place the unit in Strategic Reserves. Subtract 2 from that roll unless a Waaagh!!! is active. At the end of the battle, that unit is considered to be destroyed.">
