  <rules>
    <rule name="Orks: The Green tide(Crusade)" id="4e6d-c308-2e2f-ba7f" hidden="false">
      <description>Each time a TROOPS unit is destroyed in battle, at the end of the battle, that unit is considered destroyed, but it may be kept in the Order of Battle as if a new unit had been added, losing all it&apos;s Experience points, Battle Honours and Battle Scars, and it&apos;s Combat tallies are reset.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
