              <profiles>
                <profile name="Place Omni scrambler [Action]" id="890b-8bf7-9b6a-b9d8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the beggining of the movement phase, if the bearer&apos;s unit is in range of a Objective marker, and 6&quot; away from enemy units, can make this action. The action is ended ath the end of the fighting phase.
From that point, and until an enemy unit captures that Objective marker, enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; of the Objective marker.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
