      <profiles>
        <profile name="Dok’s Toolz [Aura]" id="550d-7583-1c84-0998" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;CLAN&gt; BIKER unit is within 3&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sawbonez" id="2695-82fd-88fd-e8c4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can heal one friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; INFANTRY, &lt;CLAN&gt; CAVALRY or &lt;CLAN&gt; BIKER model whose unit is within 3&quot; of it. 
If you do so, roll one D6: on a 1, the unit suffers 1 mortal wound. 
On a 2-4, a model regains up to 3 lost wounds.
On a 5+, either one destroyed model returns to the unit with all it&apos;s wounds, or one model regains up to 6 lost wounds.
Each unit can only be healed once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fungal Concoctions" id="21f5-8fc5-5ece-2238" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the beggining of each Fight phase, you can select a friendly ORK unit without VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords within 6&quot; of this model.
 Until the end of the phase, each time a ORK model in that unit makes a Melee attack with a weapon without the SQUIG rule, add 1 to the Strength of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
