      <profiles>
        <profile name="Dok’s Toolz [Aura]" id="2212-2d42-ca5f-bc8f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;CLAN&gt; BIKER unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sawbonez" id="8e9a-4dcd-72c7-e338" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can heal one friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;CLAN&gt; BIKER model whose unit is within 3&quot; of it. 
If you do so, roll one D6: on a 1, one model suffers 1 mortal wound. 
On a 2-4, one model regains up to 2 lost wounds.
On a 5+, either one destroyed model returns to the unit with all it&apos;s wounds, or one model regains up to 4 lost wounds.
Each unit can only be healed once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Painboy" id="6182-3aea-c1ee-1038" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="f42d-13c2-4ef0-5b8d" hidden="false" import="true">
