            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 15 &lt;CLAN&gt; INFANTRY models. 
Each MEGA ARMOUR or JUMP PACK model takes up the space of 2 models.</characteristic>
