        <profile name="Kustom Red Button" id="673c-9d6e-0db1-1222" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Command phase, roll a D6.
- On a result of 1, no effect.
- On a result of 2-3, until your next Command phase, add 3&quot; to this model’s Move characteristic.
- On a result of 4-5, until your next Command phase, in each fight phase, roll one D6 for each enemy unit within Engagement Range, and discard all but the highest result. Add the result to the Attacks characteristic of the model.
- On a result of 6, until your next Command phase, each time this model makes a ranged attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 it scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
