          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can repair one friendly BLOOD AXES VEHICLE model within 3&quot; of it. That VEHICLE model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.</characteristic>
