                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a PYROMANIACS model shoots with a Flame weapon, when determining the number of attacks for that weapon, the dice rolled results in less than 3 attacks being made, make 3 attacks instead.</characteristic>
