                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack targets a FLYBOYZ unit, if the attacker is more than 6&quot; away, then the unit with this ability is treated as having the benefits of light cover against that attack.</characteristic>
