                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A TRUKK BOYZ unit can disembark from a TRUKK even if that TRUKK has made a Normal Move this phase. 
While any TRUKK BOYZ units are embarked upon a TRUKK, each time that TRUKK model makes a ranged attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
