                <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">1</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Indirect Fire. Blast. This weapon can target units that are not visible to the bearer. The bearer can only shoot with this weapon once per battle. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, that attack scores a hit on a hit roll of 2+, irrespective of any modifiers. After shooting with this weapon, each unit within 6&quot; of the target suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
