              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight phase you can select one enemy MONSTER unit that is within 6&quot; of this model and roll one D6: on a 2+, that unit is not eligible to fight this phase until after all eligible units from your army have done so.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
